~ start
set State.in_dialogue = true

Target: Bro- Brother...?
Target: Is that you...?
Target: Long time no see.

- Assassinate Brother
	Target: How have you been, brother...
	set State.killBro = true
	set State.finished_bro_dialogue = false
	set State.in_dialogue = false
	set State.objective = "Kill Your Brother"
	set State.show_consequences = true
	=> END
	
- Hide Brother From The Boss
	Target: What... you want me to hide...?
	Target: Sure, I guess. I'll stay here for a while...
	set State.saveBro = true
	set State.finished_bro_dialogue = false
	set State.in_dialogue = false
	set State.objective = "Hide Your Brother"
	set State.show_consequences = true
	=> END